        "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a gifted member of Paranormal Property Solutions (P.P.S.), you will tackle requests from troubled clients and exorcise the evil spirits haunting their discounted property. Exercise caution as you help clients sell their house ghost-free and secure your well-earned share!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE <strong>UNKNOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the diverse range of supernatural phenomena that’s plummeting the price of the property while staying alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/4518ed7f9f87d87c4cd6fb8267ca8ddf.poster.avif?t=1760148017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/4518ed7f9f87d87c4cd6fb8267ca8ddf.webm?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/4518ed7f9f87d87c4cd6fb8267ca8ddf.mp4?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXORCISE <strong>GHOSTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brace yourself for chilling encounters with many ghosts, each possessing a uniquely horrifying visual appearance. Learn more about their patterns and write down their behaviors in your trusty journal to learn how to survive. Finding the belongings where they store their curses is key to the exorcism, but so is making it out alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/a15479c9a822b87e7326587b3bab71cb.poster.avif?t=1760148017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/a15479c9a822b87e7326587b3bab71cb.webm?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/a15479c9a822b87e7326587b3bab71cb.mp4?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Darkness</strong> <br>Apparitions do not like the light, so you can only have limited amount of lights open at any given time or else risk tripping the breaker. However, darkness in these haunted homes is not the same darkness you’re used to. Avoid it at all costs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miasma</strong> <br>Fight back against an encroaching phenomena spreading in each client’s house and cleanse it. Let it get too out of hand, and fulfilling the request might be a lost cause!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE YOUR <strong>SPECIAL ABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of characters with distinct traits, personalities, and abilities. Led by bravery, curiosity, and a relentless pursuit of truth, each member has their own unique ability to help them overcome the challenges that lay ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/baa7706a553148a516131b701d3c26ac.poster.avif?t=1760148017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/baa7706a553148a516131b701d3c26ac.webm?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/baa7706a553148a516131b701d3c26ac.mp4?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Eirene</strong></i> is a high roller tarotist that uses her cards to impose a shared fate between her and her teammate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Zay</strong></i> is a quirky school teenager that regrets joining the team but his dog sure doesn’t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Luther</strong></i> is not only a pious priest, he is also a professional gamer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Nyx</strong></i> is an occult enthusiast who’s got her hands on a true to life grimoire.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PURCHASE AND UTILIZE <strong>TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ancient relics steeped in mystery to state-of-the-art ghost detection devices, equip yourself with these visually captivating tools that seamlessly blend functionality with aesthetic appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.poster.avif?t=1760148017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.webm?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/324f6d3bd847c77b78bd6b55f07ba34a.mp4?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Gain access to a range of specialized tools to aid you in fulfilling your client requests, such as the Ghost Magnifier, Ritual Bell, Curse Sensor and Flashlight Unit. Use all of them wisely to navigate through the threats and complete the exorcism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE HAUNTED <strong>LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in meticulously designed and atmospheric environments. Discover haunted houses, eerie landscapes, and chilling locations that intensify the sense of fear and anticipation.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.poster.avif?t=1760148017\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.webm?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2115390/extras/5ed753ede86b7e257cde4ded50cbd284.mp4?t=1760148017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>With limited lights, explore the dark atmosphere as you look for clues to complete your exorcism. Just make sure to be careful of what might be around the corner..</p>",
